{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-21 11:25:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022 - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 21, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-21 08:40:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM FILES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP AND ADVISES SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 21, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANK" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-21 05:45:00', 'title': 'CLASS ACTION ALERT: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG REMIND U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ATTENTION U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP") (NYSE: USB) SHAREHOLDERS: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG ANNOUNCE THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022. IF YOU SUFFERED A LOSS ON YOUR INVESTMENT IN U.S. BANCORP, CONTACT US ABOUT POTENTIAL RECOVERY BY USING THE LINK BELOW.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-11-20 14:15:00', 'title': 'USB NOTICE: ROSEN, SKILLED INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAG